<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson expects Infocom turnaround in 97.</title>
<headline>Ericsson expects Infocom turnaround in 97.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group AB LM Ericsson's chief executive Lars Ramqvist said on Thursday he expected a turnaround for its Infocom Systems unit this year and a satisfactory result for the division in 1998.</p>
<p>Ramqvist also said its market share for mobile handsets rose by four percentage points to 16 percent.</p>
</text>
